{{en|
**Historical Crest of Real Betis Balompié**

This is a vectorized (SVG) recreation of the official crest used by the Spanish football club **Real Betis Balompié** during the period of the **Second Spanish Republic**, specifically around the **1931–1932 season**. 

Due to the absence of the crown during the republican period, the crest adopted a simple pennant shape (known as "banderín" or "bandera de pico") featuring the distinctive green and white vertical stripes, and a roundel with the intertwined initials "RBB" or "BB" (Betis Balompié) in the upper corner.

This file is a high-quality replacement for low-resolution, pixelated versions.
}}

{{es|
Escudo histórico del Real Betis Balompié. Se trata de una recreación vectorial (SVG) del escudo oficial utilizado por el club durante la época de la Segunda República Española, aproximadamente en la temporada 1931-1932. Sustituye versiones de baja calidad.
}}
